---
import Section from '../components/Section.astro'
import Box from '../components/Box.astro'
import SectionHeading from '../components/SectionHeading.astro'
import FeatureCard from '../components/FeatureCard.astro'
---

<Section spacing="none" id="features" class:list={['content-section features-section']}>
  <Box>
    <SectionHeading
      context="features"
      eyebrow="01 / Less code. More care."
      class:list={['mb-12 flex flex-col items-start gap-3']}
    >
      Thoughtful by default.
      <br />
      <span class:list={['serif italic']}>Effortless by design.</span>
    </SectionHeading>

    <div class:list={['grid grid-cols-1 gap-4 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 feature-grid']}>
      <FeatureCard title="Zero dependencies" number="01">
        <Fragment slot="icon">
          <svg
            aria-hidden="true"
            width="1.125rem"
            height="1.125rem"
            viewBox="0 0 24 24"
            fill="none"
            stroke="currentColor"
            stroke-width="1.6"
            stroke-linecap="round"
            stroke-linejoin="round"
          >
            <path d="M21 16V8a2 2 0 0 0-1-1.73l-7-4a2 2 0 0 0-2 0l-7 4A2 2 0 0 0 3 8v8a2 2 0 0 0 1 1.73l7 4a2 2 0 0 0 2 0l7-4A2 2 0 0 0 21 16z"></path>
            <path d="M3.27 6.96L12 12.01l8.73-5.05M12 22.08V12"></path>
          </svg>
        </Fragment>
        No animation library, no framework peer, no transitive packages. Import only the API your
        project needs.
      </FeatureCard>
      <FeatureCard title="Accessible by default" number="02">
        <Fragment slot="icon">
          <svg
            aria-hidden="true"
            width="1.125rem"
            height="1.125rem"
            viewBox="0 0 24 24"
            fill="none"
            stroke="currentColor"
            stroke-width="1.6"
            stroke-linecap="round"
            stroke-linejoin="round"
          >
            <path d="M2 12s3-7 10-7 10 7 10 7-3 7-10 7-10-7-10-7z"></path>
            <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="3"></circle>
          </svg>
        </Fragment>
        Visual clones stay out of the accessibility tree and keyboard order. Honors
        <code class:list={['font-mono text-text']}>prefers-reduced-motion</code> automatically.
      </FeatureCard>
      <FeatureCard title="Responsive lifecycle" number="03">
        <Fragment slot="icon">
          <svg
            aria-hidden="true"
            width="1.125rem"
            height="1.125rem"
            viewBox="0 0 24 24"
            fill="none"
            stroke="currentColor"
            stroke-width="1.6"
            stroke-linecap="round"
            stroke-linejoin="round"
          >
            <path d="M3 12a9 9 0 0 1 9-9 9.75 9.75 0 0 1 6.74 2.74L21 8"></path>
            <path d="M21 3v5h-5M21 12a9 9 0 0 1-9 9 9.75 9.75 0 0 1-6.74-2.74L3 16"></path>
            <path d="M3 21v-5h5"></path>
          </svg>
        </Fragment>
        Remeasures on resize. Call refresh() after changing content. Pauses when the ticker leaves
        the viewport or the document is hidden.
      </FeatureCard>
      <FeatureCard title="Multiple entrypoints" number="04">
        <Fragment slot="icon">
          <svg
            aria-hidden="true"
            width="1.125rem"
            height="1.125rem"
            viewBox="0 0 24 24"
            fill="none"
            stroke="currentColor"
            stroke-width="1.6"
            stroke-linecap="round"
            stroke-linejoin="round"
          >
            <circle cx="6" cy="6" r="2"></circle>
            <circle cx="6" cy="18" r="2"></circle>
            <circle cx="18" cy="6" r="2"></circle>
            <path d="M6 8v8M8 6h6a4 4 0 0 1 0 8h-4M14 14l4 4M14 18l4-4"></path>
          </svg>
        </Fragment>
        Main API, vanilla controller, browser registry, IIFE global, core types, and a CSS entry.
        Pick the surface that fits your build.
      </FeatureCard>
      <FeatureCard title="Framework agnostic" number="05">
        <Fragment slot="icon">
          <svg
            aria-hidden="true"
            width="1.125rem"
            height="1.125rem"
            viewBox="0 0 24 24"
            fill="none"
            stroke="currentColor"
            stroke-width="1.6"
            stroke-linecap="round"
            stroke-linejoin="round"
          >
            <path d="M12 2L2 7l10 5 10-5-10-5z"></path>
            <path d="M2 17l10 5 10-5M2 12l10 5 10-5"></path>
          </svg>
        </Fragment>
        Works in React, Vue, Svelte, Astro, plain HTML, WordPress, or Shopify. No adapter, no
        wrapper, no peer dependency.
      </FeatureCard>
      <FeatureCard title="Enhances your markup" number="06">
        <Fragment slot="icon">
          <svg
            aria-hidden="true"
            width="1.125rem"
            height="1.125rem"
            viewBox="0 0 24 24"
            fill="none"
            stroke="currentColor"
            stroke-width="1.6"
            stroke-linecap="round"
            stroke-linejoin="round"
          >
            <path d="M14.7 6.3a1 1 0 0 0 0 1.4l1.6 1.6a1 1 0 0 0 1.4 0l3.77-3.77a6 6 0 0 1-7.94 7.94l-6.91 6.91a2.12 2.12 0 0 1-3-3l6.91-6.91a6 6 0 0 1 7.94-7.94l-3.76 3.76z"></path>
          </svg>
        </Fragment>
        Pass a selector or DOM element. Your source is restored on
        <code class:list={['font-mono text-text']}>destroy()</code>; the controller manages
        animation markup.
      </FeatureCard>
    </div>
  </Box>
</Section>

<style>
  .feature-grid {
    gap: 0.75rem;
  }
  @media (width < 48rem) {
    .feature-grid {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
    }
  }
  @media (width < 30rem) {
    .feature-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
</style>
